  "title": "Vertical Tabs and an Upgraded Google Lens land in Opera One",
  "summary": "Hey all, A couple updates to Opera One today. First, we are introducing Vertical Tabs, a different tab layout that displays your tabs stacked along the side of your browser window. Vertical Tabs ensure the titles are always readable regardless of how many tabs you have open, making them easier to find at a glance. […]",
